### DELETE - Remove Jogador de um Grupo (200)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: {{accept-content}}

### NEGATIVO - 404 (Jogador não existe no grupo)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}/players/77777777777
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: {{accept-content}}

### NEGATIVO - 403 (Remover jogador de grupo de outro utilizador)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: {{otherToken}}
Accept: {{accept-content}}

### NEGATIVO - 403 (Grupo de outro utilizador)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: {{otherToken}}
Accept: {{accept-content}}

### NEGATIVO - 404 (Remover grupo inexistente)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/99999
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: {{accept-content}}

### DELETE - Remove Grupo {{groupId}} (204)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: {{accept-content}}
